        "user_message": "<send_user_message_question_reply>\n[{\"questionItemId\":\"[\\\"request_user_input_async\\\",\\\"call_EmMsUmr8Uup2veUz7krGMtAD\\\",0]\",\"question\":\"For the later live captures, what start block, end block and shard width should V1 and V2 use? The saved runbook reserves those choices to you, and I haven\u2019t found a recorded selection. I\u2019m continuing the audit and collector work while awaiting those values.\",\"answer\":\"The block that the first market on V1 was deployed on is the start of V1. And then V2, the block that the first V2 market.\"}]\n</send_user_message_question_reply>"
      },
      {
        "record_type": "response_item",
        "source_line": 203,
        "timestamp": "2026-09-19T17:29:33.485Z",
        "user_message": "As for the end of V1, use the block where the last Wintermute market was terminated. V2, there is no end block as such, it is still active, so as far as you can reach. Shard width I defer to you, what are the ranges/expected values?\n"
      }
    ],
